<div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto py-12">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>

  <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-8">Last updated: <%= Time.current.strftime("%B %Y") %></p>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 mt-6">What we collect</h2>
  <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
    When you create an account, we store your email address, username, and a securely hashed password.
    We also store any content you create on the platform, such as votes, comments, and profile information.
  </p>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 mt-6">How we use it</h2>
  <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
    Your data is used solely to operate the platform: authenticating you, displaying your profile,
    and showing your activity to other users where relevant (e.g., your comments and watch status).
  </p>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 mt-6">What we don't do</h2>
  <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
    We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties.
    We do not use tracking pixels, advertising networks, or third-party analytics.
  </p>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 mt-6">Data storage</h2>
  <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
    Data is stored on a PostgreSQL database hosted by Aiven and served via Render.
    Passwords are hashed using bcrypt and are never stored in plain text.
  </p>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 mt-6">Deleting your data</h2>
  <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
    You can delete your comments and content at any time. To request full account deletion,
    contact the site owner.
  </p>
</div>
